{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -900,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 1800,
      "height": 900,
      "label": "SvelteKit Frontend (SPA)",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60002",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -900,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 1800,
      "height": 500,
      "label": "Tauri 2 Rust Backend",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60003",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -900,
      "y": 1400,
      "width": 1800,
      "height": 300,
      "label": "File System",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -200,
      "y": -140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## +page.svelte\nApp entry point. Calls `store.init()` which fetches config + loads canvas file via Tauri IPC."
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60020",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -500,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## canvas-store.svelte.ts\nReactive state store (Svelte 5 `$state` runes).\n\n**State:** nodes, edges, viewport, selection, mode\n**Methods:** addNode, moveNode, resizeNode, addEdge, pan, zoom\n**Auto-save:** 500ms debounced `invoke(\"save_canvas\")`"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60030",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Canvas.svelte\nMain canvas renderer + input handler.\n\n**Keyboard:** command-based dispatch via commands.ts\n**Mouse:** drag-to-move, drag-to-resize, wheel zoom\n**Modes:** Normal, Insert, Connect, Move, Resize\n**Renders:** dot grid, SVG edge layer, DOM node layer, crosshair, status bar"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60040",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## Node.svelte\nRendered DOM nodes. Textarea in insert mode, Markdown preview in normal mode."
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60050",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## Edge.svelte\nSVG cubic bezier curves with arrows and labels. Uses shared geometry for anchor points and paths."
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60060",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -850,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## types.ts\nTypeScript types matching JSON Canvas spec.\n\nCanvasNode (Text|File|Link|Group), Edge, Canvas, Config, Viewport, Point, Side"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60065",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -850,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## tauri-mock.ts\nBrowser dev mock for Tauri API. Enables testing without desktop runtime."
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60066",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -850,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## constants.ts\nShared constants: STEP, ZOOM_STEP, BORDER_ZONE, EDGE_HIT_THRESHOLD, COLOR_PRESETS"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60067",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -850,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## geometry.ts\nShared geometry functions: attachmentPoint, detectSide, autoSides, pointInNode, bezierPath, distToBezier"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60068",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -400,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## commands.ts\nCommand registry with key dispatch.\n\nDefines all keybindings for all modes. Canvas.svelte builds a keymap and dispatches via CommandContext."
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60070",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -200,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## Tauri IPC Bridge\n`@tauri-apps/api/core.invoke()`\n\n```\ninit() → { config, file_path }\nread_canvas(path) → Canvas\nsave_canvas(path, data) → Result\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60080",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -500,
      "y": 870,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## lib.rs (Commands)\nTauri command handlers:\n- `init` — returns config + CLI file path\n- `read_canvas` — reads + deserializes JSON\n- `save_canvas` — serializes + writes JSON"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60090",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 870,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## lib.rs (Types)\nRust structs with serde (de)serialization:\n- `Canvas { nodes, edges }`\n- `Node` enum (text|file|link|group)\n- `Edge { id, fromNode, toNode, label, ... }`\n- Config structs via `config_struct!` macro"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60095",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 870,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## main.rs\nEntry point. Calls `run()` from lib.rs."
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f600a0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -500,
      "y": 1470,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## ~/.config/canvim/config.toml\nUser configuration: colors, keybindings."
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f600b0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1470,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## *.canvas (JSON files)\nJSON Canvas spec: `{ nodes: [...], edges: [...] }`"
    }
  ],
